  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pillar I: Providing 1731 Lebanese, Syrian and Palestinian refugees from Syria and Lebanon, Boys, Girls, Caregivers and Employers with holistic and integrated child protection services (Case management including emergency in kind aid, FPSS and Qudwa/CBPSS) in Tripoli, Zahle, West Bekaa, Rachaya , Beirut, Mount Lebanon, and Saida.  
Localizing and mainstreaming CP response through building the capacity of 150 professionals and community members and improving the alternative care system in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
